---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: Events, notices, roadworks and information for the Lenches villages in Worcestershire, and the weekly Thursday newsletter.
cards:
  - { title: "Events", url: "/events/", icon: calendar, text: "What's on across the villages, week by week." }
  - { title: "Notices", url: "/notices/", icon: notice, text: "Parish council notices and news from around the villages." }
  - { title: "Roads", url: "/living-here/roads/", icon: road, text: "Road closures and roadworks in and around the Lenches." }
  - { title: "Bins", url: "/bins/", icon: bins, text: "Collection days and what goes in which bin." }
communityIntro: Clubs, halls and churches across the Lenches.
communityCards:
  - { title: "Groups & Clubs", url: "/groups/", icon: users, text: "Clubs, societies and activities across the villages." }
  - { title: "Village Halls", url: "/halls/", icon: hall, text: "Church Lench and Rous Lench halls, history and bookings." }
  - { title: "Churches", url: "/churches/", icon: church, text: "Service times and readings across the ARCH Benefice." }
livingIntro: Practical information for everyone in the Lenches.
livingCards:
  - { title: "Health & emergencies", url: "/living-here/health/", icon: health, text: "GPs, pharmacies, hospitals and defibrillators." }
  - { title: "Getting around", url: "/living-here/getting-around/", icon: bus, text: "Buses, on-demand and community transport, stations." }
  - { title: "Council & planning", url: "/living-here/council/", icon: council, text: "Parish councils, councillors and planning searches." }
  - { title: "Schools", url: "/living-here/schools/", icon: school, text: "Local schools, applying and term dates." }
  - { title: "Walks & footpaths", url: "/living-here/walks/", icon: walk, text: "Circular walks, maps and the Countryside Code." }
---
{#- Four cards (hub-cards.njk), then the Community and Living here sections (folded in from
    their own pages, 24 Oct 2026; the old URLs redirect to #community and #living-here).
    Live lines are worked out at build time (every commit, and the pipeline commits several
    times a day): next event, notices added in the last 7 days
    (hidden if none), roads on now / coming up, next bin collection for the first bins.json area. -#}
{%- set nextEvent = (whatson.events | merge(pipeline.events) | upcoming) | first -%}
{%- set allN = pipeline | allNotices(whatson) -%}
{%- set newCount = allN | notRoadItems | newThisWeek -%}
{%- set roads = allN | roadItems | roadSplit -%}
{%- set roadParts = [] -%}
{%- if roads.now | length %}{% set roadParts = (roadParts.push((roads.now | length) + " on now"), roadParts) %}{% endif -%}
{%- if roads.soon | length %}{% set roadParts = (roadParts.push((roads.soon | length) + " coming up"), roadParts) %}{% endif -%}
{%- set bin = bins | nextBin -%}
{%- set live = {
  "/events/": ("Next: " + nextEvent.title + " · " + (nextEvent.date | shortDate)) if nextEvent else "",
  "/notices/": (newCount + " new this week") if newCount else "",
  "/living-here/roads/": roadParts | join(" · ") if roadParts | length else "No works listed",
  "/bins/": (bin.area + ": " + (bin.date | shortDate) + ", " + (bin.bins | andList)) if bin else ""
} -%}
<main class="container">

  <section class="intro">
    <p class="intro-head">News, events and information for our five villages, and a newsletter every Thursday.</p>
    <p class="muted">Everything here is collected from local groups, organisations and residents, and kept as accurate and up to date as we can manage.</p>
  </section>

  {% include "signup.njk" %}

  <section class="home-cards">
    {% include "hub-cards.njk" %}
  </section>

  <section id="community" class="home-section">
    <h2>Community</h2>
    <p class="muted">{{ communityIntro }}</p>
    {% set cards = communityCards %}{% set cardHeading = "h3" %}{% include "hub-cards.njk" %}
  </section>

  <section id="living-here" class="home-section">
    <h2>Living here</h2>
    <p class="muted">{{ livingIntro }}</p>
    {% set cards = livingCards %}{% include "hub-cards.njk" %}
  </section>

  {% include "lenches-map.njk" %}

  {#- Feedback form at the foot of the page, below the map (other pages: above the sign-up band). -#}
  <div class="home-feedback">{% include "feedback.njk" %}</div>

</main>
